  "brief": "Swarmer: a small, fast, fragile hostile drone that rushes the crew in packs in zero-g. Compact armoured insect-like shell, a cluster of sensor eyes on the front, four small swivelling thruster pods, and a stubby twin gun turret under the body. Bone-white plates, black joints and underside, cyan eyes and thruster glows. Revision: the weak spot is a hot-magenta reactor core exposed at the back between the rear pods (visible from behind and above-behind, hidden from the front), SOCKET_weak at its centre; thruster glow and small status lights on emissive_secondary; longer, jointed legs and a dorsal crest for a spider outline at range.",
